":{"title":"init(base:store:maxAttempts:seedsFromCache:maxCacheAge:retryBaseDelay:now:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a resilient decorator around "},{"code":"base","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", persisting last-known-good"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"through "},{"code":"store","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/init(base:store:maxattempts:seedsfromcache:maxcacheage:retrybasedelay:now:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"base","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PaywallService","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall0B7ServiceP"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"store","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeyValueStore","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux13KeyValueStoreP"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxAttempts","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"seedsFromCache","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxCacheAge","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Duration","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"retryBaseDelay","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Duration","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"now","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Date","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DateV"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/init(base:store:maxAttempts:seedsFromCache:maxCacheAge:retryBaseDelay:now:)","role":"symbol"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/customerInfoStream()":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"customerInfoStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EntitlementSnapshot"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Long-lived stream of entitlement updates. Yields the persisted","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"last-known-good first (when ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"seedsFromCache"},{"text":" is on and the cache is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"still usable), then forwards and persists every snapshot the base","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stream emits.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/customerInfoStream()","title":"customerInfoStream()","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/customerinfostream()"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/PaywallService":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PaywallService","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Provider-agnostic paywall service protocol."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PaywallService","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"PaywallService","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/paywallservice"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/currentSnapshot()":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"currentSnapshot"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EntitlementSnapshot"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Non-throwing read for callers that always want a snapshot, degrading to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"free only for a genuinely-unknown user. Convenient for building a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"per-request monetization context off the main actor.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/currentSnapshot()","title":"currentSnapshot()","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/currentsnapshot()"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/customerInfo()":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"customerInfo"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EntitlementSnapshot"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Fetches the current entitlement status, retrying up to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxAttempts"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"with exponential backoff. On success persists and returns; if every"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attempt fails, returns the cached last-known-good when present and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"usable, otherwise rethrows (so the plugin’s honest "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".refreshFailed"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"path is preserved for a genuinely-unknown user). Cancellation stops","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"retrying immediately and falls through to the cache.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/customerInfo()","title":"customerInfo()","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/customerinfo()"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/s8SendableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/s8SendableP","title":"Swift.Sendable","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/restorePurchases()":{"title":"restorePurchases()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Restores previously completed purchases, forwarding to the base service."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Persists on success; rethrows on failure (a restore is an explicit user","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"action, so the plugin keeps the prior state)."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/restorepurchases()","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"restorePurchases","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntitlementSnapshot","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/restorePurchases()","role":"symbol"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/PaywallPlugin":{"title":"PaywallPlugin","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A Swidux plugin that manages paywall state and entitlement checking."}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PaywallPlugin"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/paywallplugin","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PaywallPlugin"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallPlugin","role":"symbol"}}}